  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating Inclusive Business Models for Marginalized Tribal Communities in Odisha, Jharkhand and Madhya Pradesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed PDO is to create employment and sustainable livelihood opportunities to reduce poverty amongst the unemployed youth, women and other marginalized communities in the tribal regions of Odisha, Jharkhand and Madhya Pradesh through supporting their traditional and artisanal skills.</narrative>
  </description>
